sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant A as AgentLoop
    participant P as Planner
    participant R as ToolRegistry
    participant S as AgentState

    U->>A: goal + message
    A->>S: initialize
    A->>P: create initial plan
    P-->>A: plan steps
    loop until done or max_iterations
        A->>A: choose next action
        alt missing required field
            A->>S: status = waiting_for_user
        else tool action
            A->>R: execute(action)
            R-->>A: observation
            A->>S: reduce(action, observation)
        end
        A->>A: decide continue/replan/finish
    end
    A-->>U: final answer or controlled status
